uplink-typan-l2-bundle-name = L2-PK machine gun
uplink-typan-l2-bundle-desc = The L2-PK is a handheld machine gun from the TechnicLogistic family, developed from the L6 platform. It is accurate and cheap to produce, but still very bulky.

uplink-typan-magboots-adv-name = Blood-black magboots
uplink-typan-magboots-adv-desc = Modern magboots that slightly boost movement speed. Gorlex-made for Gorlex operators. They also have increased storage volume.

uplink-typan-hardsuit-patrol-name = Syndicate patrol hardsuit
